{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"32378dc487b2e9ba19db6543839c38bd054a8a307c816c1c8cd93e6f3b98ad4e","ja":"オリジナルの能力","zh":"原创的能力","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"38ad4f2b6d23795cf8e8647cd21d7328621e3ecbc30c00a3e39aa94227ff23b6","ja":"今日の亜美たち4人のお仕事は、生配信！\nドラマでも出てきた喫茶店からのお届けで……","zh":"今天亚美她们4个人的工作是网络直播！\n要在电视剧中也出现过的咖啡店进行直播……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5929514e2c3f66f469e252386caa2de17725ebd3622e956b0631f4180c71e193","ja":"やっほー！　みんな～、亜美たちの\nめーっちゃカワイイ顔、ちゃんと見えてる～？","zh":"呀吼——！大家～，都有看清\n亚美她们超～级可爱的脸孔吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e4494cd64f35030ed38f8ef2822c1478d1df5f70974afa91f69d389bea46f15f","ja":"あ、みんなコメントしてくれてる！　うん！\n亜美ちゃんと未来がスイーツ食べてた喫茶店だよ～♪","zh":"啊，大家都来评论了！嗯！\n就是亚美和未来吃甜点的那家咖啡店哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"28a17c1f77504e9639bbb5e8788c39eecd39519c4c9ea98ad78516396469bc9b","ja":"それじゃあさっそく、みなさんからいただいた\n感想や質問について、お話ししていきますね♪","zh":"那么马上就来聊聊\n大家发来的感想和提问吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8b1a196de62497e9af100b0b58b61dae1a34e8fb177843c10018007c6485c4b7","ja":"まずはこちら！　「ドラマの続き、すっごく\n気になります！　先生はどうなったの！？」だって。","zh":"首先是这一条！“电视剧后续真的\n超级让人在意！老师到底怎么样了！？”说是。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9696e1fbbbac0da51e82202df24829fbf501462712379dba3fc622b19baa8082","ja":"わかるな～！　あの終わり方、すっごく\n気になるよね！　実は、あの後は……。","zh":"我懂～！那种结尾方式，让人超级\n在意的对吧！其实，在那之后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d377cee43ba3594e133e8727e4e7503568b509353feeedd884196dd4d1129a33","ja":"あれっ？　未来、知ってるの？","zh":"哎？未来，你知道吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"55789843fc8bea5d6a9f0e246f56905faa4914569390291b78d13980d0028579","ja":"えっ！？　え～っと……。\nそ、そういえば、知らなかった。でへへ～。","zh":"诶！？　这个嘛……。\n这、这么说来，我还真不知道呢。嘿嘿～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"b743809f76385ac3a1d90e070c273b4a800f247a277db998e6694d7bffaa85ae","ja":"それじゃあ、次のお便りだよ！","zh":"那么，来看下一封来信吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"fe1655e3dbd120b6b99d2cd395df0845f420a10355d120b48fb9d5515cbef456","ja":"「ドラマみたいな特別な能力を得られるなら、\nどんな能力がいいか、みんなで考えてみてください」","zh":"“如果能获得电视剧里那种特别的能力，\n大家会想要什么样的能力呢？请一起来想一想吧”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"3c470937089644d9082b8daceace33536140a4c3d4c97105591c1e8723bb32ea","ja":"杏奈はね～……『ゲームの世界に入れる能力』！\nゲームに入って、ビビッと大活躍するんだ♪","zh":"杏奈想要～……“能进入游戏世界的能力”！\n进入游戏里，酷炫地大显身手哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"aa019684c5eb068fcd3702b7ededdfa9837b7539f22d620263dc6ef685a2b07e","ja":"わぁっ、楽しそうっ♪　じゃあ私は、\n『いつでもどこでも、みんなに歌を届けられる能力！』","zh":"哇，好像很有意思♪那我就选\n“无论何时何地，都能为大家送去歌声的能力！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"86eb7f38850232863c4c42696fc8ed798957d17922fde8a0e5b42602a33ab88c","ja":"どっちも素敵な異能力だね。私は何がいいかな……。\n私も『物語に入れる能力』とか……。","zh":"两种异能力都很棒呢。我选什么好呢……\n我也选“进入故事的能力”之类的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"f90e99a7676a5218668d2b091a036f5af1808a2510dc69900cd887752ee32c50","ja":"あ、それなら『本をたくさん持ち運ぶ能力』が\nいいかも。いつでも、好きな本が読めるから。","zh":"啊，要是那样的话，“搬运大量书籍的能力”\n感觉挺不错的。因为这样就能随时随地读喜欢的书了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"905d13c5c40400cc6959deb6d7c50a0cadee9d8c010d497985231ab62e5d44e9","ja":"それなら、『いつでも本を取り出せる能力』のほうが\nいいと思うよ。かさばらないし。","zh":"那我觉得“随时都能拿出书的能力”\n更好哦。而且还不占地方。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"b430a483e62e64228bdd253c386cd32ce72abd16949f5e573b9c6909cf4e810c","ja":"そういう亜美ちゃんは、どんな能力がいいの？","zh":"那亚美想拥有什么样的能力呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1639.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"cc9d5b6fcebd788c8261f850907c4e9752278c70c36839c2094740e9fe131d3e","ja":"んっふっふ～♪　亜美が考えた能力はね……\n答えは、CMの後で！","zh":"嗯哼哼～♪ 亚美想出的能力是呢……\n答案就在广告之后揭晓！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
